# Docs Pack

Use this pack when documentation is part of the delivery contract.

## Rules

- Keep docs aligned with current behavior.
- Update docs in the same change when commands, setup, public behavior, or workflow rules change.
- Separate public docs from internal implementation notes when audiences differ.
- Do not leave important process decisions only in chat.

## Verification

- Run available docs checks.
- If docs checks are not configured, review changed docs manually and record the limitation.

